{"run": "digest", "t": 32035, "kind": "dbg", "msg": "wiki: NOT COVERED [Law and crime] 2019 Sri Lanka Easter bombings — A Sri Lankan court sentences former police chief Pujith Jayasundara to death for negligence in failing to prevent the 2019 Easter bombings, which killed 279 people. Sri Lanka has not carried out an execution since 1976."}
